```ts
updateWorkflow(id: string, body: { name?: string; description?: string; steps?: WorkflowStep[] }): Workflow | null {
  const workflow = this.workflows.find((item) => item.id === id && item.scope === 'user')
  if (!workflow) return null
  const changed = Object.entries(body).filter(([, v]) => v !== undefined)
  if (changed.length === 0) {
    throw new MockAdminRuleError('validation_error', '至少需要修改一个字段')  // 后端 PATCH 空体 422？不确定。做不做？
  }
  assertWorkflowFields({ name: ..., description: ..., steps: ... })
  if (body.name !== undefined) workflow.name = body.name.trim()
  if (body.description !== undefined) workflow.description = body.description
  if (body.steps !== undefined) workflow.steps = clone(body.steps)
  workflow.version += 1
  workflow.updated_at = new Date().toISOString()
  return clone(workflow)
}
```
PATCH 空 body → 422？后端 Pydantic PATCH（WorkflowUpdate 全可选）空体合法，version+1？不确定后端行为。YAGNI：不做"至少一个字段"校验（避免臆造行为）。空 body → version+1？那也无妨。嗯，其实 PATCH 空 body 后 version+1 有点怪。但既然不确定，保持最简单：有字段就更新并 version+1。空 body 也 version+1（不特殊处理）。好吧——或者：changed.length===0 时直接返回当前 workflow 不 bump version？臆造。就用"无条件 version+1"（brief 说 "PATCH 后 version+1"）。测试只测有字段的 PATCH。

